Gyro trellis quantization reference decoder
Copyright 2026 AgentionAI (Laurent Zuijdwijk)

This directory vendors, unmodified, the normative reference decoder and
codebook for the Gyro trellis tensor formats TQ2_T, TQK4..TQK7 and TQP5..TQP7
(`tq_ref.c`, `tq_ref.h`, `tq_codebook.c`) from AgentionAI's Gyro project:

  https://gitlab.com/agentionai-group/agention-gyro

Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see licenses/gyro.txt).
Gufo's Flash-Next kernels in `../kernels/rocm/trellis.*` are original work that
follows the byte-level format defined here; the CPU dequantization path uses
this decoder as its reference.
